# Release signing - NEVER commit. Losing this keystore means every future
# release build gets a different signature, breaking in-place updates for
# anyone who already installed a build signed with it. Back it up somewhere
# safe (password manager / encrypted drive) outside of git.
/keystore.properties
/app/release.keystore
*.jks
